  "description": "DAO Database.Execute with dbFailOnError of column and constraint DDL over existing data: ADD COLUMN X2 TEXT(5), fill with 'abcde', ALTER COLUMN X2 TEXT(3) (narrowing), ALTER COLUMN S LONG (holds 'x'), ALTER COLUMN V TEXT(10) (indexed), DROP COLUMN U (uniquely indexed); CREATE UNIQUE INDEX and ADD CONSTRAINT UNIQUE over duplicates in T2; CREATE INDEX ... DESC WITH IGNORE NULL then DROP INDEX; DROP CONSTRAINT FK_C2 and re-adding a FOREIGN KEY over an orphan; CHECK constraints over violating and satisfied rows. Asks each return and Errors, then the shapes and rows of T, T2 and C2.",
